.DS_Store

# Capacitor: node_modules, the assembled web payload and the generated native
# projects are all build output. `npx cap add` recreates ios/ and android/ from
# capacitor.config.json on every CI run, so nothing hand-edited may live there.
native/node_modules/
native/www/
native/ios/
native/android/
native/icons/

# Playwright (e2e/): dependencies and run output
e2e/node_modules/
e2e/test-results/
e2e/playwright-report/
